Error [E0749]: `pure_compute` reaches the `Net` effect, which it prohibits with `#(!Net)`
  --> tests/ui/effect_prohibition_violated.jet:5:28
    |
  5 | fn pure_compute(x: Int) #(!Net) -> Int {
    |                            ^^^
 Why: a `#(!Net)` annotation means the function and every callee it can reach must not use `Net`
 Fix: remove the call that introduces `Net`, or drop the `#(!Net)` prohibition
